            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.44

- A stolen phone token can no longer run anything or get past Face ID.
- Your phone explains and steers rotation: who's next, why a session moved, what's left.
- Remote recovers by itself from dropped connections and sleep, and offers Pair Again when it can't.
- Settings follow you across copies of Side A and your other Macs.
- Update Side A Remote to build 12 to use it with this version.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
